{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "283be2da038e63c553388bf9c15f4a91f457fcd289ec7463f683d68364daaacf", "ja": "（今日はブライダル雑誌の企画で、\n真のグラビア撮影が行われたのだが……）", "zh": "（今天按照婚礼杂志的企划进行了真君的写真拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "45e9af0c9d5bc70e267893d128f4ef6666cc9b18978aa3d7215466e1f213d881", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました。着替え\nてきました！　……って、それ、さっきの写真ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了。我换好衣服回来了！……咦，那是刚才拍的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "617656755812dc30c95a2c18f747d08b84cca19cccf00bff9a63c74556a2ebaa", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ様。\nうん、どれもカッコよく撮れてて、いい写真だなと。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n嗯，每张都拍得很帅，我觉得是很不错的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1a307f4bf54e1eb588fb824c37f4521c9833c870457c7250a87a510fd8a40522", "ja": "本当ですか？　へへっ、やーりぃ！\n仕上がりが楽しみだなぁ！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，太棒啦！\n真期待成片啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ee43fe7c65f9f841b958bc7798697b3d4dc9e4baa4dabf0225612a665036a7bc", "ja": "そうだな。\nけど……今日は、悪かったな。", "zh": "是啊。\n不过……今天真是对不住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "9b82f49d5f941cdefa536b58d635c6501e398bdf2043dde84bfce5a7f79348c1", "ja": "え？　急にどうしたんですか？\n何か謝られること、ありましたっけ？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这么说？\n有什么需要向我道歉的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e3ffb7bb5ff022e7e744b3b767adc9b7f296920b9b44b808dcedbbb541a53381", "ja": "タキシード衣装のことだよ。\n「ドレスも着たかった」って言ってただろ？", "zh": "是关于燕尾服服装的事。\n你不是说过“也想穿礼服”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "915bb701c85801f0bbea70729099aee0985d5203f5d68a21048f353e2988c196", "ja": "あ、なるほど……。こちらこそ、すみません！\nなんだか、ちょっとワガママ言っちゃって。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……。该道歉的是我才对！\n不知不觉就有点任性了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "8a18c53fd416960601e74cc469a1d6ad1e9346a410d45bde3326531b0f4a1b10", "ja": "確かにドレスも素敵だなって思いましたけど……\n大丈夫です！　今日の撮影、大満足でしたから！", "zh": "确实，我也觉得礼服很漂亮……\n没关系！今天的拍摄，我非常满意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b29460c4caf4a2b845f7ca683dd699fd3594b3da6849e15571fcf503856e93e1", "ja": "そうなのか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "f1c9e5acfaad6f451994327ef2e010600fe374172def03e3d1b466531dd5f1a7", "ja": "はい！　衣装を見た時、素直に思ったんです。\nボクにピッタリの衣装だな……って！", "zh": "是的！看到服装的时候，我就由衷地觉得……\n这真是最适合我的服装啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e7edf23d83832d0695c21b301f93cb1bb1fc6d409b713028da60eb97891cf82", "ja": "きっと{$P$}も、同じように感\nじたから、今回はボクを新郎役にしたんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}一定也有同样的感觉，所以这次才让我演新郎，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33fa71327c7fc96e3f0f8d4910e9018d12566023b6e6dbad49875ac31587f5a8", "ja": "ああ。ドレスも検討はしたんだが、今回は\nこのタキシードが一番、真の魅力を出せると思ってな。", "zh": "嗯。我也考虑过礼服，但这次还是觉得这身晚礼服最能展现真真正正的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "05b72511b641e5d15974a3274468dd1185e8ddf7289bce412ebb1b2942403278", "ja": "へへ、だと思いました！　真剣に考えてくれたん\nだから、むしろ嬉しいですよ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我就知道！你那么认真地替我考虑，我反而觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "1353fbe4e44bc27ad23fdece15da19e797523a4552ad8457fc8148271367f8d0", "ja": "おかげで、ボクの良さを、ボク自身も信じられるし……\n何より、みんなに喜んでもらえるのが一番ですからね！", "zh": "多亏了你，我连自己都能相信自己的优点了……毕竟最重要的，还是能让大家感到开心嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1015_p", "source_sha256": "886b4209536f3dc9fd53fe8288562c8d9d9a913b09a7feeed944875b4926fbcd", "ja": "そう言ってもらえるとありがたい。見立てどおり、\n真の魅力がしっかり伝わる、いい撮影だったしな。", "zh": "听你这么说，我就放心了。正如你判断的那样，这次拍摄很成功，充分展现了真的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb148281569f755abb6a37331601562dc58048b38b7b197ea8495250fed483f2", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　それに、あくまで\n今日はお仕事。本当に結婚するわけじゃないですしね。", "zh": "谢谢您！而且说到底，今天只是工作。也不是真的要结婚嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0623_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "c0aa818aef7b84396e19c4ec6eacfb08b61b6fc570e66388bca8873dc2f86a0b", "ja": "素敵なドレスは本番……未来のパートナーのとなりで、\nカワイく着ちゃおうと思います。なーんて、へへっ♪", "zh": "漂亮的礼服，还是等到正式场合……在未来的伴侣身边，再可可爱爱地穿给他看吧。开玩笑的啦，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
